    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. it just feels like sometimes these bugs are so random and hard to pin down, like they just show up out of nowhere even when the code looks fine. do you have any other strategies for dealing with those kinds of unpredictable little glitches that disrupt the flow?",
